{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-116-1","title":"Psalms 116:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The psalmist professes his love and duty to God for his deliverance. 12 He studies to be thankful.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3468. B.C. 536. (Title.)From several instances of the Chaldee dialect being used in this Psalm, it appears to have been written after the Babylonian captivity.</p>\n<p>love. 18:1-6; 119:132; Mr 12:33; Joh 21:17; 1Jo 4:19; 5:2,3 because. 18:6; 31:22,23; 34:3,4; 40:1; 66:19,20; 69:33; Ge 35:2; 1Sa 1:26 Joh 16:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-2","title":"Psalms 116:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>therefore. 55:16,17; 86:6,7; 88:1; 145:18,19; Job 27:10; Lu 18:1; Php 4:6 Col 4:2 as long as I live. Heb. in my days.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-3","title":"Psalms 116:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>sorrows. 18:4-6; 88:6,7; Jon 2:2,3; Mr 14:33-36; Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7 gat hold upon me. Heb. found me. I found. 32:3,4; 38:6; Isa 53:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-4","title":"Psalms 116:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>called. 22:1-3; 30:7,8; 34:6; 50:15; 118:5; 130:1,2; 2Ch 33:12,13 Isa 37:15-20; 38:1-3; Joh 2:2 O Lord. 6:4; 22:20; 25:17; 40:12,13; 142:4-6; 143:6-9; Lu 18:13; 23:42,43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-5","title":"Psalms 116:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Gracious. 86:5,15; 103:8; 112:4; 115:1; 145:8; Ex 34:6,7; Ne 9:17,31; Da 9:9 Ro 5:20,21; Eph 1:6-8; 2:4; 1Ti 1:14; Tit 3:4-7 and righteous. 119:137; 145:4-7,17; Ezr 9:15; Ne 9:8,33; Isa 45:21; Da 9:7,14 Ro 3:25,26; 1Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-6","title":"Psalms 116:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>preserveth. 19:7; 25:21; Isa 35:8; Mt 11:25; Ro 16:19; 2Co 1:12; 11:3; Col 3:22 I was. 79:8; 106:43; 142:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-7","title":"Psalms 116:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>thy rest. 95:11; Jer 6:16; 30:10; Mt 11:28,29; Heb 4:8-10 dealt. 13:6; 119:17; Ho 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-8","title":"Psalms 116:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>For thou. 56:13; 86:13 mine. Isa 25:8; 38:5; Re 7:17; 21:4 and my feet. 37:24; 94:18; Jud 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-9","title":"Psalms 116:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>walk. 61:7; Ge 17:1; 1Ki 2:4; 8:25; 9:4; Lu 1:6,75 in the land. 27:13; Isa 53:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-10","title":"Psalms 116:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I believed. 2Co 4:13; Heb 11:1 therefore. Nu 14:6-9; Pr 21:28; 2Pe 1:16,21 I was greatly. 3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-11","title":"Psalms 116:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>in my. 31:22; 1Sa 27:1 All. 2Ki 4:16; Jer 9:4,5; Ro 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-12","title":"Psalms 116:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>51:12-14; 103:2; Isa 6:5-8; Ro 12:1; 1Co 6:20; 2Co 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-13","title":"Psalms 116:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will take. 17; Lu 22:17,18,20; 1Co 10:16,21; 11:25-27 call. 2; 105:1; Isa 12:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-14","title":"Psalms 116:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>pay my vows. 18; 22:25; 56:12; 66:13-15; Jon 1:16; 2:9; Na 1:15; Mt 5:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-15","title":"Psalms 116:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Precious. 37:32,33; 72:14; 1Sa 25:29; Job 5:26; Lu 16:22; Re 1:18; 14:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-16","title":"Psalms 116:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>truly. 86:16; 119:125; 143:12; Joh 12:26; Ac 27:23; Jas 1:1 the son. 86:16 thou hast. 107:14-16; 2Ch 33:11-13; Isa 61:1; Ro 6:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-17","title":"Psalms 116:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the sacrifice. 50:14; 107:22; Le 7:12; Heb 13:15 call. 13; Ac 2:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-18","title":"Psalms 116:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>14; 22:25; 76:11; Ec 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-116-19","title":"Psalms 116:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":116,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":116,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>96:8; 100:4; 118:19,20; 122:3,4; 135:2; 2Ch 6:6</p>"}]}